<Base title="Store Information & Policies | NASA IPTV"><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1 class="page-title" data-en="Store information & policies" data-ar="معلومات المتجر والسياسات">Store information & policies</h1></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container legal"><h2 data-en="Ordering" data-ar="الطلبات">Ordering</h2><p data-en="This website is a product catalogue. Orders and payment instructions are handled directly via WhatsApp. We do not collect card details or process payments on this site." data-ar="هذا الموقع كتالوج للمنتجات. يتم ترتيب الطلبات وتعليمات الدفع عبر واتساب، ولا نجمع بيانات البطاقات أو نعالج المدفوعات هنا.">This website is a product catalogue. Orders and payment instructions are handled directly via WhatsApp. We do not collect card details or process payments on this site.</p><h2 data-en="Digital products" data-ar="المنتجات الرقمية">Digital products</h2><p data-en="Subscriptions and application licenses are digital products. App licenses do not include IPTV subscriptions or streaming content unless explicitly stated. Device compatibility must be confirmed before ordering." data-ar="الاشتراكات وتراخيص التطبيقات منتجات رقمية. لا تتضمن تراخيص المشغلات اشتراك IPTV أو محتوى بث ما لم يُذكر ذلك صراحة. يجب التأكد من توافق الجهاز قبل الطلب.">Subscriptions and application licenses are digital products. App licenses do not include IPTV subscriptions or streaming content unless explicitly stated. Device compatibility must be confirmed before ordering.</p><h2 data-en="Refunds and consumer rights" data-ar="الاسترداد وحقوق المستهلك">Refunds and consumer rights</h2><p data-en="Contact support for product-specific terms before payment. Any cancellation or refund rules are subject to applicable consumer laws; statutory rights are not excluded." data-ar="تواصل مع الدعم لمعرفة شروط المنتج قبل الدفع. تخضع أحكام الإلغاء والاسترداد لقوانين حماية المستهلك المعمول بها، ولا تُلغى الحقوق القانونية.">Contact support for product-specific terms before payment. Any cancellation or refund rules are subject to applicable consumer laws; statutory rights are not excluded.</p><h2 data-en="Third-party content" data-ar="محتوى الأطراف الأخرى">Third-party content</h2><p data-en="Only use streaming services and content you are authorized to access. App availability and license terms may change. Product listings should be reviewed by the site owner before launch." data-ar="استخدم فقط خدمات البث والمحتوى الذي تملك حق الوصول إليه. قد تتغير التطبيقات وشروط الترخيص. يجب مراجعة المنتجات من مالك الموقع قبل الإطلاق.">Only use streaming services and content you are authorized to access. App availability and license terms may change. Product listings should be reviewed by the site owner before launch.</p></div></section></Base>
